<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Mongoose Gang</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1970s</span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Mongoose Gang was a private militia used by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/eric-gairy">Eric Gairy</a>, Grenada's chief minister and then prime minister, to intimidate and attack his opponents in the 1970s. Its members beat protesters and opposition figures, including New Jewel Movement leaders such as <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/maurice-bishop">Maurice Bishop</a>. The gang was disbanded after the revolution of March 1979 that overthrew Gairy.</p></div>
